{
  "chapter.47554816341E14DF.title": "&dThe Chonkdom",
  "chapter.47554816341E14DF.chapter_subtitle": [
    "19. Become a recruit of The Snuggle Order",
  ],
  "quest.4755480FF8BF7CE0.title": "How Do You Get Here?",
  "quest.4755480FF8BF7CE0.quest_desc": [
    "Find the collapsed order temple in the Guhmension and step through the portal: The Chonkdom, an adventure world all of its own.",
    "",
    "Become a recruit of &dthe Snuggle Order&r, play through the zones, defeat the Stardousing Tower and find every little secret. Any character and any mode counts: the quests check themselves off as soon as you've done it in The Chonkdom.",
    "",
    "Every quest gives a &eshowpiece&r for your own world. You claim it at home, in the Guhmension or the normal world: inside The Chonkdom itself you can't.",
    "",
    "Not every zone is open yet. When a new zone opens, its quests appear here by themselves.",
  ],
  "task.475548200ABB492B.title": "Training on Snuggle Camp done",
  "quest.4755483E612A24FE.title": "Become a Recruit of the Snuggle Order",
  "quest.4755483E612A24FE.quest_desc": [
    "Find the collapsed order temple in the Guhmension and step through the portal. On &dSnuggle Camp&r Sergeant Fluffball teaches you the trade: finish your training by cheering up the Blob Giant. Any character and any mode counts: once is enough.",
    "",
    "&7Reward: a showpiece for your own world. You claim it at home, in the Guhmension or the normal world; inside The Chonkdom itself you can't.",
  ],
